      "section_id": "SEC-2A16955F6D4289C6",
      "section_path": [
        "5 电气连接",
        "5.4 与逆变器连接",
        "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接"
      ],
      "section_title": "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n数据采集器最多支持9 路RS485 总线，每路RS485 总线最多支持80 台逆变器接入，最\n多支持300 台设备接入。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.366,
        297.844,
        465.588,
        322.297
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-170E7F9B95AC5D4E",
      "document_id": "DOC-D9C0DEB31D45",
      "source_sha256": "bd8dee22b45f3effc4323f330fd4db2eb92ab544cc41fc56835e0e5cd8eec71d",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 29,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 2,
      "section_id": "SEC-2A16955F6D4289C6",
      "section_path": [
        "5 电气连接",
        "5.4 与逆变器连接",
        "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接"
      ],
      "section_title": "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n不同的设备类型必须接入数据采集器不同的RS485 端口，例如箱变与逆变器接入数据采\n集器不同RS485 通讯口。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.366,
        326.344,
        463.554,
        350.797
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-76AEC7BAE6FF9FAA",
      "document_id": "DOC-D9C0DEB31D45",
      "source_sha256": "bd8dee22b45f3effc4323f330fd4db2eb92ab544cc41fc56835e0e5cd8eec71d",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 29,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 3,
      "section_id": "SEC-2A16955F6D4289C6",
      "section_path": [
        "5 电气连接",
        "5.4 与逆变器连接",
        "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接"
      ],
      "section_title": "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n每路RS485 总线上所有设备的地址，都必须在数据采集器设置的地址范围（1~246）\n内，而且不能出现重复，否则会导致通信失败。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.366,
        354.844,
        452.835,
        379.297
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-C981127ACDE49A7F",
      "document_id": "DOC-D9C0DEB31D45",
      "source_sha256": "bd8dee22b45f3effc4323f330fd4db2eb92ab544cc41fc56835e0e5cd8eec71d",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 29,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 4,
      "section_id": "SEC-2A16955F6D4289C6",
      "section_path": [
        "5 电气连接",
        "5.4 与逆变器连接",
        "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接"
      ],
      "section_title": "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n每路RS485 总线上所有设备的串口参数，均与数据采集器的串口参数保持一致。串口参\n数包括波特率、数据位、停止位、校验位。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.366,
        383.344,
        463.554,
        407.797
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-E5B9437EC71F5956",
      "document_id": "DOC-D9C0DEB31D45",
      "source_sha256": "bd8dee22b45f3effc4323f330fd4db2eb92ab544cc41fc56835e0e5cd8eec71d",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 29,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 5,
      "section_id": "SEC-2A16955F6D4289C6",
      "section_path": [
        "5 电气连接",
        "5.4 与逆变器连接",
        "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接"
      ],
      "section_title": "5.4.1 与RS485端口型逆变器连接",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n为保障系统通信稳定与数据准确，请确保同一绕组下的逆变器使用同一条RS485 通道接\n入数据采集器。不同绕组下的逆变器不得通过RS485 串联的方式接入数据采集器，否则\n可能导致数据采集失败，由此产生的问题不在保修范围内。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.366,
        411.844,
        463.554,
        449.797
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
